    {
      "id": "INDIRECT-023",
      "source": "uncertain",
      "description": "R1C1 style (a1 FALSE) is refused until a Windows run observes it (ADR-0124, 2026-10-10); Microsoft documents 45, and with no excelExpect Excel's answer reads as a disagreement, so whether the engine follows it or keeps refusing is decided with the answer",
      "cells": {"A2": "B2", "A3": "B3", "A4": "George", "A5": "5", "B2": "1.333", "B3": "45", "B4": "10", "B5": "62", "ZZ1000": "=INDIRECT(\"R3C2\",FALSE)"},
      "check": "ZZ1000",
      "expect": {"value2": "#VALUE!"}
